---@field Denominator? aws.mediaconvert.__integer The denominator, or bottom number, in the fractional aspect ratio. For example, for a display aspect ratio of 16 / 9, the denominator would be 9.
---@field Numerator? aws.mediaconvert.__integer The numerator, or top number, in the fractional aspect ratio. For example, for a display aspect ratio of 16 / 9, the numerator would be 16.

