---@field ChannelLayout? aws.mediaconvert.__string The audio channel layout of the track, such as "mono", "stereo", "5.1", or "7.1". Object-based or immersive audio is reported as "5.1.4" or "7.1.4". The layout is exact for AC-3 and E-AC-3 audio. For other codecs, it is inferred from the channel count and should be treated as approximate.
