---@field PricingPlan? aws.mediaconvert.PricingPlan|string Specifies whether the pricing plan for the queue is on-demand or reserved. For on-demand, you pay per minute, billed in increments of .01 minute. For reserved, you pay for the transcoding capacity of the entire queue, regardless of how much or how little you use it. Reserved pricing requires a 12-month commitment. When you use the API to create a queue, the default is on-demand.
---@field ReservationPlanSettings? aws.mediaconvert.ReservationPlanSettings Details about the pricing plan for your reserved queue. Required for reserved queues and not applicable to on-demand queues.
