---@field TilePadding? aws.mediaconvert.H265TilePadding|string Set to "padded" to force MediaConvert to add padding to the frame, to obtain a frame that is a whole multiple of the tile size. If you are setting up the picture as a tile, you must enter "padded". In all other configurations, you typically enter "none".
